type: dataset
keywords:
  - blood group antigens
  - ABO
  - Rh
  - RHD
  - RHCE
  - Duffy
  - ACKR1
  - Kell
  - KEL
  - Kidd
  - SLC14A1
  - MNS
  - non-coding variants
  - base editing
abstract: >
  A curated database of non-coding and regulatory variants across six ISBT
  human blood group systems (ABO, RH, MNS, KEL, FY/Duffy, JK/Kidd; genes ABO,
  RHD, RHCE, GYPA, GYPB, KEL, ACKR1, SLC14A1), compiled from primary
  literature, ISBT allele tables, and RhesusBase, annotated with gnomAD/TOPMed
  population frequencies, validation evidence tiers, and CRISPR base-editing
  (BE4max/ABE8e) feasibility.
